    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "7481e6b6-2816-4509-91fa-fcd2189348fa",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EAll excursion travel \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EEntrance fees to non-National Trust properties included\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ETrain \u0026amp; boat tickets included\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBlue Badge guide on Days 2 to 4\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "f234b60b-505b-4a9a-96c0-7ea32628e393",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe stay four nights on a half board basis at the 3* Damson Dene Hotel (\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.damsondene.co.uk\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003Ewww.damsondene.co.uk\u003C/a\u003E) at Crosthwaite. Located in a countryside setting, five miles from Bowness-on-Windermere, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, indoor swimming pool, Jacuzzi, steam room and sauna. All rooms are en suite and feature television, telephone, hairdryer, and tea \u0026amp; coffee making facilities.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a00f052f-2581-4b24-a04e-a49db5a87615",
      "key": "1c27f259-4b44-4094-af45-231458a1c593",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "c843e16f-aaa9-4df1-a584-6d36bcdd8c9f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDunham Massey\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EDove Cottage\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EGrasmere\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECruise on Ullswater\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EHolker Hall\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELakeside \u0026amp; Haverthwaite Steam Railway\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ECruise on Lake Windermere\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003EBlackwell\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ESizergh Castle \u0026amp; Gardens\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003ELittle Moreton Hall\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "e2627e3b-5585-4291-b59f-8fc40dbac466",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "3f23aede-c9a6-425b-93a3-44e600e17b65",
            "7481e6b6-2816-4509-91fa-fcd2189348fa",
            "f234b60b-505b-4a9a-96c0-7ea32628e393",
            "c843e16f-aaa9-4df1-a584-6d36bcdd8c9f",
            "8b8b5c86-f413-4477-a3cd-2853c6ed3360",
            "8c0fa8ca-89fd-44d9-bdce-665700af966f",
            "1c27f259-4b44-4094-af45-231458a1c593"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "3f23aede-c9a6-425b-93a3-44e600e17b65",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe depart by private executive coach from our designated pick up points and taking carefully selected comfort stops en route we visit the National Trust\u2019s Dunham Massey near Altrincham, an elegant Georgian mansion with a sumptuous Edwardian interior filled with a fine collection of paintings, furniture and Huguenot silver. We continue to the 3* Damson Dene Hotel at Crosthwaite for a four night stay on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. On arrival in Grasmere we visit Dove Cottage, William Wordsworth\u2019s home from 1799 to 1808. Here Wordsworth wrote much of his poetry, and his sister Dorothy kept her famous journals. We then spend some time at leisure for lunch in Grasmere. This afternoon we enjoy an included cruise on Ullswater with our Blue Badge guide, sailing from Pooley Bridge to Glenridding where our coach meets us.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHolker Hall is our destination with our Blue Badge guide this morning. Home to the Cavendish family, this grand Victorian mansion is lavishly furnished, with marble fireplaces, splendid linenfold panelling, fine plasterwork and intricate carving. We then take a journey on the Lakeside \u0026amp; Haverthwaite Steam Railway, taking us through the Levan Valley, one of the Lake District\u2019s most beautiful valleys. We then join a 45 minute one way cruise to Bowness- on-Windermere, affording us wonderful views of the Lake and its shores.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning we visit Blackwell, one of England\u2019s most important surviving houses from the turn of the 20th century. Designed by M.H. Baillie Scott, the house occupies a stunning position overlooking Windermere and is a fine example of Arts and Craft movement architecture. With our Blue Badge guide this afternoon we visit the National Trust\u2019s Sizergh Castle and Gardens, a medieval house extended in Elizabethan times and surrounded by beautiful grounds. With more than 750 years of history and centuries old portraits sitting alongside modern family photos, this medieval house is still home to the Strickland family. Inside the impressive wood panelling culminates in the exquisite patterned panels of the Inlaid Chamber. The house is surrounded by rich gardens and a 1,600 acre estate, combining a newly created wetland, limestone pastures, orchards and semi natural woodland, all inhabited by a rich variety of wildlife. There is a unique and very special limestone rock garden, where the colours change with the seasons.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter checking out of our hotel and before returning home we visit the National Trust\u2019s Little Moreton Hall in Cheshire. Begun in 1504 and completed 100 years later, Little Moreton Hall is regarded as the finest example of a timber-framed moated house in the country. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route, we return back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
